1
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:17,700
Every table can be sorted and filtered. Here is the Closed tab.

2
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:23,880
Click a column header to sort by it. Click again to reverse the order.

3
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:27,690
Click Filters to show a filter box under each header.

4
00:00:27,790 --> 00:00:31,510
Click the one for the column you want, here Instrument.

5
00:00:31,610 --> 00:00:34,820
Move instruments between Visible and Invisible. This button hides them all.

6
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:39,090
Then pick one, here AUDCAD, and move it back to Visible.

7
00:00:39,190 --> 00:00:43,410
Click Ok.

8
00:00:43,510 --> 00:00:47,270
Now only AUDCAD trades are listed.

9
00:00:47,370 --> 00:00:51,220
Click the cross next to Filters to clear every filter.

